        <mxCell id="TVZiNVFLYEzhVGz_t42O-74" value="The forwarding scheme with no fwd in decode stage, but with precount in this stage. The all forwarding is in the execute stage. It needs the register wd_W_reg after MEM/WB buffer, because it is used in fwd. This problem can&#39;t be solved by register file writeback in first half of the cycle (this solution breaks the timings)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
